%N A400581 Increasingly isolated totient numbers.
%C A400581 Let T_i be the totient numbers (A002202). T_i is in the sequence if the smaller of T_i - T_(i-1) and T_(i+1) - T_i is larger than that for all smaller values of i.
%e A400581 Totient number 36 is a distance of 4 from its nearest neighbor, more than any smaller totient number, so 36 is in the sequence.
%Y A400581 Cf. A002202, A394635.
